\F1
\c7Caller-ID reports you are not calling from the phonenumber entered as your
data number. For automatic validation CID information must match with the
data in your account.

If you will normally be calling from this number, please use the \c3US\c7 command
to correct the information.

Please do not change the data number if you are calling from a location other
than the one you will normally be calling from. In the future non-subscribers
may only be allowed access from the number they were validated with.

\c6Press \c7\z4ANY KEY\z0\c6 to continue\g1\q1